Hi {Owner},

I build websites and referral and recruiting systems for home health agencies around {City}. Looking at {Business Name} as a family, a discharge planner and a nurse, each hit a wall: one contact page for several branches, no online referral, and a careers link that goes to email.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting first: branch pages with the towns each office covers, levels of care explained, a privacy-safe referral portal and careers pages by role, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

It makes no outcome claims and goes through your compliance review before launch. A build like this runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, privacy-safe forms and changes.

Would thirty minutes with you and your intake lead be worthwhile?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
